WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.922
A Jaba Lompo, sẽn yaa pĩnd-n-bãngdã. Bãngr-gomd a ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.650
Gullmanse rãmbã sẽn yi zĩig ningã pa zemsd taab ye. Neb kẽer pa sak n loe-b ne a Moyiis ye, la b gomda rao sẽn yi zĩig a to yelle.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:34.320
A yembr yeelame t'a Jaba Lompo yii saasẽ n zao wed-bil sẽn yaa pemse.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:52.088
A wa n waa tẽns nins sẽn be Eastern soolmẽ wã yʋʋm kob-gĩnd 13 soabã pʋgẽ.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.584
Nebã ra gũusda ne tẽn-zẽng nin-kãnga.

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.612
Tall-y biigã n wa ne maam.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:24.154
A Zezi wõgemdame n gãneg bi-riblã zugu, la biigã yikame. Rẽ n so tɩ d kelg-a lame.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:50.080
A ra lobda rũmsã, la a ra karemda beoog-daare b sã n wa lʋɩt taoore.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.400
A yãee yel-bũnd n yã tẽng sẽn be tãnga zugu.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:07.120
Yãmb tẽngã na n yɩɩ tãnga zugu.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:27.920
A Zozɛf kẽngame n ta zĩig ning b sẽn da beẽ wã, la a gãda a raad n yeel tɩ yaa tẽn-kãnga.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:34.160
Yaa Bingo, sẽn na n lebg Fada N'Gourma wã.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.096
Yãk-y n tool-y neda.

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:03.696
A Jaba Lompo zĩnda be, la a ra yaa bãngd la taoor soaba.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.608
Tõnd yii tẽn-zãrse n na n ges-a.

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:39.360
M kom-bõonego, bɩ y maneg soolem a taabã.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:47.040
A yagensã kẽnga zĩis a taab n na n paas tẽnga pʋga.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:18.090
Rũndã-rũndã, a Fada N'Gourma tẽegda a sẽn lugl-a wã yelle. Yaa bũmb a taab me la d segd n tũ.
